DESCRIPTION:Room: OV Pickle West 1\, 2\; OV Pickle East 1\, 2\nLocatio
 n: Ocotillo Village\nPickleball at Ocotillo Village.  Every Sunday\, 
 Tuesday\, Wednesday\, Thursday and Friday each week. \n\nBe sure to t
 ake alook at the Basketball Court Schedule.  A sign is on display as 
