 the Flyer Wall.\n\n4 Courts are available for all player levels who w
 ant to have a fun\, socialize and recreational play.\n\nCertified Pic
 kleball Coach\, James Cole will be providing Coaching and Instruction
  for those who are needing or wanting some extra instruction or 1 on 
 1 Coaching.\n\nThe Basketball Court will not be open for for Basketba
 ll play until after the Scheduled Pickleball Open Play Times are over
 .\n\nPlay time is reserved for the first 20 that register on the Vill
 age Mobile App.  Registration opens 48 hours prior to the day and tim
 e of the next scheduled Pickleball Open Play.   Rules and Play Policy
  will be posted at the Court.\n\n*There will be no Officials. Honesty
  and Good Sportsmanship will be expected at all times.
