SUMMARY:OV Pickleball Open Play (120m)
DESCRIPTION:Room: OV Pickle West 1\, 2\nLocation: Ocotillo Village\nPi
 ckleball at Ocotillo Village.  Every Sunday\, Tuesday\, Wednesday\, T
 hursday and Friday each week. \n\nBe sure to take alook at the Basket
 ball Court Schedule.  A sign is on display as you enter the Basketbal
 l Court and take home Flyers are available on the Flyer Wall.\n\n4 Co
 urts are available for all player levels who want to have a fun\, soc
 ialize and recreational play.\n\nCertified Pickleball Coach\, James C
 ole will be providing Coaching and Instruction for those who are need
 ing or wanting some extra instruction or 1 on 1 Coaching.\n\nThe Bask
 etball Court will not be open for for Basketball play until after the
  Scheduled Pickleball Open Play Times are over.\n\nPlay time is reser
 ved for the first 20 that register on the Village Mobile App.  Regist
 ration opens 48 hours prior to the day and time of the next scheduled
  Pickleball Open Play.   Rules and Play Policy will be posted at the 
 Court.\n\n*There will be no Officials. Honesty and Good Sportsmanship
  will be expected at all times.
END:VEVENT
